///         Van Eck's sequence. For n >= 1, if there exists an m &lt; n such that a(m) = a(n), take the largest such m and set a(n+1) = n-m; otherwise a(n+1) = 0. Start with a(1)=0.
///     </para>
///     <para>
///         OEIS: http://oeis.org/A181391.
///     </para>
/// </summary>
